<title>SPAIN: Bank Spain leaves key rate unchanged at 5.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank Spain leaves key rate unchanged at 5.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain said on Thursday it left its key money rate unchanged at 5.25 percent at today's regular repurchase tender for central bank certificates.</p>
<p>It allotted 3.16 trillion pesetas against 3.41 trillion bid.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
</text>
